[ takes stdin as input and gives it to stdout ]
[ .00000000 ] 0c000000 00000000 00000000 0e300000 80000000 aaaaaaaa
[ .0c000000 ] 06200000 02000000 04000000 [ read std in ]

[ jump if read input ]
[ .02100000 ] 32000000 5c100000 10000000 [ copies read bit into the next line length argument ]
[ .08100000 ] 0c300000 00000000 00000000 [ sets program counter or not depending on the previous line ]

[ .0e100000 ] 04200000 02000000 12000000 [ exit ]
[ .04200000 ] c3000000 00000000 00000000 [ exit code and read codes ]

[ jump here ]
[ .0a200000 ] 08300000 02000000 04000000 [ write call ]
[ .00300000 ] 00400000 00000000 02000000 [ jump to start ]

[ .06300000 ] 00000000 10000000 10000000 [ zeros and write codes ]
[ .0c300000 ] 04200000 00000000 06000000 [ exit, read byte and reset pointers ]


